              id="50494b27-c7eb-47ba-9eea-cbc24ef98f17" name="Load Workspace" description="&lt;p>Interprets the recalled artifact content and reconstructs the corresponding in-memory workspace state (e.g., selected artifacts, prompts, tool context), preparing it for interactive use by the agent.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
