              id="3d2e0b43-c7df-4352-ab3b-5c35de8c5862" name="Deliver Content" description="&lt;p>Packages the serialized workspace representation (following the IO schema) and delivers it to the storage layer, linking it with any related artifacts or trace information needed for replay.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
