                  id="0ab0e8f4-43eb-4208-be37-6ab9b1f3b3e8" name="Interactive Console"
                  description="&lt;p>Provides the primary user interface for the Systems Engineering Agent.&lt;br />&#xA;It manages conversational interaction, visualization of artifacts, and now also supports Guided Session workflows&amp;mdash;allowing the user to start a session from a prompt artifact, review attached context, exchange messages with the agent, and conclude the session to create a summary artifact.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
