              <ownedLogicalComponents xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.la:LogicalComponent"
                  id="27841793-490c-4f48-a7bf-d584515e1119" name="Prompt Registry and Fomatter"
                  description="&lt;p>Stores reusable prompts and applies context-specific formatting before sending to the LLM Interface.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h1 data-end=&quot;249&quot; data-start=&quot;212&quot;>🧠 Prompt Definition Registry (PDR)&lt;/h1>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;283&quot; data-start=&quot;251&quot;>What you&amp;rsquo;re really proposing is:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote data-end=&quot;369&quot; data-start=&quot;285&quot;>&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;369&quot; data-start=&quot;287&quot;>Treat prompts like engineering assets &amp;mdash; versioned, typed, queryable, and reusable.&lt;/p>&#xA;&lt;/blockquote>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;384&quot; data-start=&quot;371&quot;>Exactly like:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;477&quot; data-start=&quot;385&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;437&quot; data-start=&quot;385&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;437&quot; data-start=&quot;387&quot;>Artifact Registry (files, YAML, workspace objects)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;477&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;477&quot; data-start=&quot;440&quot;>Tool Registry (callable capabilities)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;487&quot; data-start=&quot;479&quot;>Now add:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;520&quot; data-start=&quot;488&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;520&quot; data-start=&quot;488&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;520&quot; data-start=&quot;490&quot;>&lt;strong data-end=&quot;520&quot; data-start=&quot;490&quot;>Prompt Definition Registry&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;577&quot; data-start=&quot;522&quot;>And suddenly your planner becomes dramatically smarter.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;hr data-end=&quot;582&quot; data-start=&quot;579&quot; />&#xA;&lt;h2 data-end=&quot;620&quot; data-start=&quot;584&quot;>Why This Is Bigger Than It Sounds&lt;/h2>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;659&quot; data-start=&quot;622&quot;>Right now, your planner reasons over:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;720&quot; data-start=&quot;660&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;677&quot; data-start=&quot;660&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;677&quot; data-start=&quot;662&quot;>Available tools&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;699&quot; data-start=&quot;678&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;699&quot; data-start=&quot;680&quot;>Workspace artifacts&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;708&quot; data-start=&quot;700&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;708&quot; data-start=&quot;702&quot;>Memory&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;720&quot; data-start=&quot;709&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;720&quot; data-start=&quot;711&quot;>Contracts&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;752&quot; data-start=&quot;722&quot;>But it does &lt;em data-end=&quot;739&quot; data-start=&quot;734&quot;>not&lt;/em> reason over:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;793&quot; data-start=&quot;753&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;793&quot; data-start=&quot;753&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;793&quot; data-start=&quot;755&quot;>Reusable structured engineering intent&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;848&quot; data-start=&quot;795&quot;>With a Prompt Definition Registry, the planner could:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1038&quot; data-start=&quot;850&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;881&quot; data-start=&quot;850&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;881&quot; data-start=&quot;852&quot;>Select a known report pattern&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;913&quot; data-start=&quot;882&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;913&quot; data-start=&quot;884&quot;>Select an evaluation template&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;945&quot; data-start=&quot;914&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;945&quot; data-start=&quot;916&quot;>Select a comparison framework&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;971&quot; data-start=&quot;946&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;971&quot; data-start=&quot;948&quot;>Select an FMEA scaffold&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1005&quot; data-start=&quot;972&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1005&quot; data-start=&quot;974&quot;>Select a BOM validation routine&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1038&quot; data-start=&quot;1006&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1038&quot; data-start=&quot;1008&quot;>Select a CSID publish template&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1051&quot; data-start=&quot;1040&quot;>Instead of:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote data-end=&quot;1082&quot; data-start=&quot;1052&quot;>&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1082&quot; data-start=&quot;1054&quot;>&amp;ldquo;Let me improvise a prompt&amp;hellip;&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p>&#xA;&lt;/blockquote>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1095&quot; data-start=&quot;1084&quot;>It becomes:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote data-end=&quot;1160&quot; data-start=&quot;1096&quot;>&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1160&quot; data-start=&quot;1098&quot;>&amp;ldquo;Let me instantiate a known prompt definition with variables.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p>&#xA;&lt;/blockquote>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1175&quot; data-start=&quot;1162&quot;>That is huge.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;hr data-end=&quot;1180&quot; data-start=&quot;1177&quot; />&#xA;&lt;h1 data-end=&quot;1215&quot; data-start=&quot;1182&quot;>🔧 What Is a Prompt Definition?&lt;/h1>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1266&quot; data-start=&quot;1217&quot;>A Prompt Definition is &lt;strong data-end=&quot;1265&quot; data-start=&quot;1240&quot;>not a rendered prompt&lt;/strong>.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1306&quot; data-start=&quot;1268&quot;>It is a structured artifact like this:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-end=&quot;1659&quot; data-start=&quot;1308&quot;>&#xA;&#xA;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/pre>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&quot;contain-inline-size rounded-2xl corner-superellipse/1.1 relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary&quot;>&#xA;&lt;div class=&quot;sticky top-[calc(var(--sticky-padding-top)+9*var(--spacing))]&quot;>&#xA;&lt;div class=&quot;absolute end-0 bottom-0 flex h-9 items-center pe-2&quot;>&#xA;&lt;div class=&quot;bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary text-token-text-secondary flex items-center gap-4 rounded-sm px-2 font-sans text-xs&quot;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div>&#xA;&lt;/div>&#xA;&lt;/div>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&quot;overflow-y-auto p-4&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;>&lt;code class=&quot;whitespace-pre! language-json&quot;>&lt;span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>{&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot;>&amp;quot;prompt_def&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>,&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;version&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;>2&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>,&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;title&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot;>&amp;quot;Component Report&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>,&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot;>&amp;quot;Generates structured report for a LogicalComponent&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>,&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;inputs&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>{&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;component_name&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot;>&amp;quot;string&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>,&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;phase&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot;>&amp;quot;ArcadiaPhase&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>,&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;include_related&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot;>&amp;quot;boolean&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>}&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>,&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span> &lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-attr&quot;>&amp;quot;template&amp;quot;&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-punctuation&quot;>:&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span