uot; data-start=&quot;5185&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5212&quot; data-start=&quot;5187&quot;>Deterministic tool chains&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5266&quot; data-start=&quot;5214&quot;>You&amp;rsquo;re building something that can scale beyond you.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;hr data-end=&quot;5271&quot; data-start=&quot;5268&quot; />&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5303&quot; data-start=&quot;5273&quot;>If you want, next step we can:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;5415&quot; data-start=&quot;5305&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;5334&quot; data-start=&quot;5305&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5334&quot; data-start=&quot;5307&quot;>Design the PromptDef schema&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;5354&quot; data-start=&quot;5335&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5354&quot; data-start=&quot;5337&quot;>Define categories&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;5380&quot; data-start=&quot;5355&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5380&quot; data-start=&quot;5357&quot;>Define lifecycle states&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;5415&quot; data-start=&quot;5381&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5415&quot; data-start=&quot;5383&quot;>Define planner integration logic&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5454&quot; data-start=&quot;5417&quot;>This feels like a foundational brick.&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;5494&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot; data-start=&quot;5456&quot;>And yes&amp;hellip;&lt;br data-end=&quot;5467&quot; data-start=&quot;5464&quot; />&#xA;I absolutely like this one.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
                <ownedFunctionalAllocation xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:ComponentFunctionalAllocation"
                    id="a704d47b-4493-4f37-b0fb-ec948fe8ac2e" targetElement="#f1a109a8-5a60-4d83-89a0-a92b4ff4e975"
                    sourceElement="#27841793-490c-4f48-a7bf-d584515e1119"/>
                <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:ComponentPort"
                    id="9a554e8e-5f5b-4cb8-878c-0df2ea708648" name="CP 1" orientation="OUT"
                    kind="FLOW"/>
                <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.cs:Part" id="37b1a94e-ef28-4b13-9eaa-e43bc61c9886"
                    name="Prompt Defintion Registry" abstractType="#91724697-7ad2-4772-9a5f-6e553bdea583"/>
                <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.cs:Part" id="d622da7a-07e9-4e6a-8feb-7fed404c17d1"
                    name="Prompt Formatter" abstractType="#7adc1ad1-665e-4c07-b6b1-89c133702bc1"/>
                <ownedLogicalComponents xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.la:LogicalComponent"
                    id="91724697-7ad2-4772-9a5f-6e553bdea583" name="Prompt Defintion Registry"
                    description="&lt;p data-end=&quot;352&quot; data-start=&quot;314&quot;>&lt;strong data-end=&quot;323&quot; data-start=&quot;314&quot;>Role:&lt;/strong> index + search + lifecycle&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;690&quot; data-start=&quot;353&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;410&quot; data-start=&quot;353&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;410&quot; data-start=&quot;355&quot;>loads prompt defs (JSON) from &lt;code data-end=&quot;410&quot; data-start=&quot;385&quot;>package.prompt_defs.dir&lt;/code>&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;479&quot; data-start=&quot;411&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;479&quot; data-start=&quot;413&quot;>validates schema (builder guarantees structure; registry enforces)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;573&quot; data-start=&quot;480&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;573&quot; data-start=&quot;482&quot;>builds a &lt;em data-end=&quot;510&quot; data-start=&quot;491&quot;>lightweight index&lt;/em> for the planner (ids/tags/requires/produces/version/path/hash)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;641&quot; data-start=&quot;574&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;641&quot; data-start=&quot;576&quot;>supports query (&amp;ldquo;show me report prompts that require YAML in LA&amp;rdquo;)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;690&quot; data-start=&quot;642&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;690&quot; data-start=&quot;644&quot;>optional: drafts/published, metrics, last-used&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;">
                  <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:ComponentPort"
                      id="8f698b70-4899-40b0-86ce-f2e6f96057f3" name="CP 6" orientation="OUT"
                      kind="FLOW"/>
                  <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:ComponentPort"
                      id="43aaff32-28bc-454e-8362-0ee47977fbab" name="CP 1" orientation="IN"
                      kind="FLOW"/>
                  <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:ComponentPort"
                      id="dee517c7-e86e-4a89-8799-7b6d6b583873" name="CP 5" orientation="IN"
                      kind="FLOW"/>
                  <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:ComponentPort"
                      id="a7990cdb-6723-4c09-b9ff-a90f9ef83276" name="CP 2" orientation="INOUT"/>
                  <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:ComponentPort"
                      id="ef888f10-d224-49db-88be-069cfbd8c43f" name="CP 7" orientation="OUT"
                      kind="FLOW"/>
                </ownedLogicalComponents>
                <ownedLogicalComponents xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.la:LogicalComponent"
                    id="7adc1ad1-665e-4c07-b6b1-89c133702bc1" name="Prompt Formatter"
                    description="&lt;p data-end=&quot;784&quot; data-start=&quot;716&quot;>&lt;strong data-end=&quot;725&quot; data-start=&quot;716&quot;>Role:&lt;/strong> instantiate a prompt def into a rendered prompt artifact&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;989&quot; data-start=&quot;785&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;845&quot; data-start=&quot;785&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;845&quot; data-start=&quot;787&quot;>input: &lt;code data-end=&quot;809&quot; data-start=&quot;794&quot;>prompt_def_id&lt;/code> + &lt;code data-end=&quot;818&quot; data-start=&quot;812&quot;>vars&lt;/code> (+ context contract hooks)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;900&quot; data-start=&quot;846&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;900&quot; data-start=&quot;848&quot;>output: &lt;code data-end=&quot;864&quot; data-start=&quot;856&quot;>prompt&lt;/code> artifact (post-rendered, canonical)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;989&quot; data-start=&quot;901&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;989&quot; data-start=&quot;903&quot;>optionally attaches provenance: &lt;code data-end=&quot;978&quot; data-start=&quot;935&quot;>{prompt_def_id, version, hash, vars_used}&lt;/code> for replay&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1019&quot; data-start=&quot;991&quot;>That&amp;rsquo;s the clean separation:&lt;/p>&#xA;&#xA;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;1088&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1052&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1052&quot; data-start=&quot;1022&quot;>&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1042&quot; data-start=&quot;1022&quot;>Registry chooses&lt;/strong> (planner)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;li data-end=&quot;1088&quot; data-start=&quot;1053&quot;>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;p data-end=&quot;1088&quot; data-start=&quot;1055&quot;>&lt;strong data-end=&quot;1076&quot; data-start=&quot;1055&quot;>Formatter renders&lt;/strong> (execution)&lt;/p>&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/li>&#xA;&lt;/ul>&#xA;">
                  <ownedFeatures xsi:type="org.polarsys.capella.core.data.fa:ComponentPort"
                      id="bbf26651-7fa8-43ab-86c2-66fa532f9337" name="CP 1" orientation="IN"
                      kind="FLOW"/>
                </ownedLogicalComponents>
              </ownedLogicalComponents>
