                  id="e9d9ed2c-f2e7-4eff-9c0e-b01881b69544" name="Contract Manager"
                  description="&lt;p>Controls the active interaction contract for the agent (e.g., DEFAULT, SESSION). It interprets events and state from the Decision and Reasoning Core and Governance Layer to determine when to switch modes. In particular, it now manages transitions into and out of Guided Session mode when a session is started from a prompt artifact or concluded via user commands.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
