                description="&lt;p>Connects to external and internal knowledge sources, indexes artifacts into vector-based stores, and performs semantic retrieval. Provides grounded context (snippets, embeddings, and citations) to the Decision and Reasoning Core and tools via the LLM Interface. Current implementation uses OpenAI vector stores and file search, but the architecture is vendor-neutral.&lt;/p>&#xA;">
